{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_json_rpc", "label": "JSON-RPC.md (RFC path design record)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_sap_gateway_jsonrpc_service", "label": "SAP Gateway JSON-RPC 2.0 service (/IWBEP/CL_JSRPC_*)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ADT can read and write ABAP code but cannot execute it; the Gateway JSON-RPC service dispatches to RFC-enabled function modules, which closes the gap."}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_sso_session_reuse", "label": "SSO session reuse for JSON-RPC", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L27", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The CSRF token harvested from the ADT bootstrap is byte-identical to the one JSONRPC.INIT hands out, so no extra fetch is needed."}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_library_retry_guard_trap", "label": "abap-adt-api never retries in stateful mode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The library's re-login-on-401 is guarded by !isStateful and the server sets stateful, so the handler does its own single re-bootstrap retry."}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_wire_protocol", "label": "JSON-RPC wire protocol (read from ABAP source)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L57", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_lowercase_key_trap", "label": "Silent lower-case parameter key drop", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CALL TRANSFORMATION id matches component names case-sensitively and silently ignores unmatched ones, so buildParams upper-casing names is load-bearing, not cosmetic."}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_rfc_get_function_interface", "label": "RFC_GET_FUNCTION_INTERFACE signature source", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L123", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The same function module /IWBEP/CL_JSRPC_FUNCTION->init uses, so the signature cannot disagree with the call; ADT search proved unreliable (FUGR/FF truncation, same-name shadowing)."}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_adt_signature_fallback", "label": "ADT source signature fallback (parseFunctionInterface)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L131", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_readable_not_callable", "label": "A readable signature is not a callable function module", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L143", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_s_rfc_group_check", "label": "S_RFC checked per function group", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L156", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_batch_luw", "label": "JSON-RPC batch shares one LUW", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L166", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "_PROCESSOR->process runs batch members in order within one HTTP request, ABAP session and LUW; the only way for an update BAPI and BAPI_TRANSACTION_COMMIT to commit the same LUW. Observed live, not inferred."}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_runcalls_pipeline", "label": "runCalls -> invokeJsonRpcBatch -> parseJsonRpcBody path", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L200", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_validation_all_or_nothing", "label": "Up-front batch validation, per-member execution errors", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L221", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_rfccaller_injection", "label": "Injected RfcCaller seam (DdicHandlers)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L252", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DdicHandlers takes an injected RfcCaller function rather than a handler reference, so the two stay independent, DdicHandlers unit-tests with a stub, and construction order does not matter."}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_error_map", "label": "JSON-RPC error map", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L280", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_sldw_whitelist", "label": "SLDW whitelist SAP_JSON_RPC_FUNCTION_MODULES", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L348", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_type_traps", "label": "SYST-LANGU CHAR1 and NUMC type traps", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L270", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_json_rpc_stdout_logger_bug", "label": "Logger wrote info/debug to stdout (fixed bug)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/JSON-RPC.md", "source_location": "L367", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null